  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 87 × 24 ÷ 12 – 16 + 14 = 176 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : − and +​\n\nGiven statement : 87 × 24 ÷ 12 – 16 + 14 = 176 \n\nAfter interchanging\n\n87 × **24 ÷ 12**__ + 16 - 14 = 176\n\n__**87 × 2**__ + 16 - 14 = 176\n\n__**174 + 16**__ - 14 = 176\n\n__**190 - 14**__ = 176\n\n176 = 176 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and +\n\nGiven statement : 87 × 24 ÷ 12 – 16 + 14 = 176 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n87 + **24 ÷ 12**__ – 16 × 14 = 176\n\n87 + 2 – __**16 **____**×**____** 14**__ = 176\n\n__**87 + 2**__ - 224 = 176\n\n__**89 - 224**__ = 176\n\n-135 ≠ 176 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and +\n\nGiven statement : 87 × 24 ÷ 12 – 16 + 14 = 176 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n87 × 24 + 12 – **16 ÷ 14**__ = 176\n\n__**87 × 24**__ + 12 – 1.14 = 176\n\n__**2088 + 12**__ - 1.14 = 176\n\n__**2100 - 1.14**__ = 176\n\n2098.86 ≠ 176 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : × and ÷\n\nGiven statement : 87 × 24 ÷ 12 – 16 + 14 = 176 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n**87 ÷ 24**__ × 12 – 16 + 14 = 176\n\n__**3.625 **____**× 12**__ – 16 + 14 = 176\n\n__**43.5 + 14**__ - 16 = 176\n\n__**57.5 - 16**__ = 176\n\n41.5 ≠ 176 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
